      "excerpt": "ClimateLaunchpad – Thank you for your application Facebook – Instagram – LinkedIn – YouTube About the competition Back Competition info Apply now Trainers FAQ About Us Participating countries Back Participating countries Become a national organiser Partners Back Our partner network Partner up Blog Thank you for your application Thank you for applying to ClimateLaunchpad 2026. The selection process in each country is managed by our local partners, known as National Leads – they will be in touch with you following the selection process. Coming up: Online video mini-course Please stay tuned! You will receive updates shortly! In the meantime, please follow us on Facebook , Instagram & LinkedIn . ClimateLaunchpad is the world’s largest green business ideas competition, established and managed by Climate KIC . 000 : 00 : 00 Global Partners Founding Partner Competition Application form About the competition Trainers FAQ About CLP Info Participating countries News (Success) stories Quick links Partner up Become a National Lead Login National leads Follow us Terms & conditions – Privacy policy – Cookie settings Cookie Settings We use cookies to deliver and improve our services, analyze site usage, and if you agree, to customize or personalize your experience and market our services to you. You can read our Privacy Policy here . Customize Accept Cookie Settings Our website uses cookies"
