      "excerpt": "ClimateLaunchpad – CLP 26 – Final Cohort Confirmation Facebook – Instagram – LinkedIn – YouTube About the competition Back Competition info Apply now Trainers FAQ About Us Participating countries Back Participating countries Become a national organiser Partners Back Our partner network Partner up Blog CLP 2026 Accepted Startups CLP 26 – Final Cohort Confirmation ClimateLaunchpad 2026 – Final Cohort Confirmation Thank you for running the national selection process for ClimateLaunchpad 2026. Now that your selection is complete, please use this form to officially confirm the startup(s) that make up your country’s final cohort. This information will be used to register your startups in the official ClimateLaunchpad global database! Thank you for your continued partnership! Facebook This field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged. Feedback on the Boot Camp Experience Name of your Organisation * Country * Angola Argentina Australia Austria Brazil Cabo Verde Colombia Costa Rica Cyprus Czechia Ecuador Egypt El Salvador Estonia Fiji Finland France Germany Ghana Greece Guatemala India Indonesia Japan Kenya Madagascar Mexico Moldova Morocco Namibia Netherlands Nigeria Papua New Guinea Peru Philippines Portugal Sierra Leone Singapore South Africa South Korea Spain Switzerland Tanzania Türkiye Uganda United Kingdom United States Vanuatu Vietnam Please select from the"
