    {
      "id": "check-page-6dd55e8b57",
      "url": "https://climatelaunchpad.org/about-climatelaunchpad/",
      "page": "details",
      "excerpt": "ClimateLaunchpad – About Us Facebook – Instagram – LinkedIn – YouTube About the competition Back Competition info Apply now Trainers FAQ About Us Participating countries Back Participating countries Become a national organiser Partners Back Our partner network Partner up Blog Competition About Us Who we are ClimateLaunchpad is powered by an international team dedicated to advancing early-stage climate innovation and strengthening ecosystems that support it. Together with our network of expert trainers, partners and National Leads, we support people just like you to take the first steps in turning bold climate ideas into real-world solutions. As part of Climate KIC ’s entrepreneurship ecosystem, we work at the intersection of innovation, learning, and impact, unlocking the potential of people who want to build a sustainable, climate-resilient future. Why we exist ClimateLaunchpad was created to unlock the potential of climate entrepreneurs everywhere by giving them a free platform to test ideas, build skills, and connect with the people who can help them move forward. Climate change demands bold ideas, but early-stage innovators often lack access to the resources , networks , and support needed to develop them. We exist to change that . Powered by Climate KIC ClimateLaunchpad is part of Climate KIC , a leading climate innovation initiative established in 2010 by the European"
