      "id": "check-page-a4cd17c857",
      "url": "https://climatelaunchpad.org/competition/",
      "page": "details",
      "excerpt": "ClimateLaunchpad – About the competition Facebook – Instagram – LinkedIn – YouTube About the competition Back Competition info Apply now Trainers FAQ About Us Participating countries Back Participating countries Become a national organiser Partners Back Our partner network Partner up Blog Competition About the competition ClimateLaunchpad: We pitch in for the planet Big change starts with brave ideas. If you have an idea for the climate, you’re in the right place. No matter who you are or where you come from, ClimateLaunchpad will help you take the first steps to shape your green or sustainable idea into a business, build a plan, craft a compelling pitch, and turn early vision into real-world impact. Why join ClimateLaunchpad? 🌍 The world’s largest green business ideas competition 🚀 Running every year since 2014 💡 18,000+ ideas submitted by innovators just like you 🌱 5,400+ teams supported worldwide to develop and grow their ventures Your idea belongs here. Let’s build it together. How it works ClimateLaunchpad is built for early-stage climate innovators, especially if you’re at the idea or concept stage. No company yet? No funding? No finished product? No problem. If you have a climate solution you want to explore, this is where you start. Our free programme guides you step-by-step through the fundamentals of building and testing a climate venture, in a supportive, global"
    },
